<title>USA: Robert Bass group lifts BP Prudhoe stake.</title>
<headline>Robert Bass group lifts BP Prudhoe stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Texas billionaire Robert Bass said Thursday it raised its stake in BP Prudhoe Bay Royalty Trust to 1,829,000 units, or 8.5 percent of the company's units of beneficial interest outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 619,900 additional units betweeen Decembver 11 and January 9 at prices ranging from $16.30 to $16.67 a share.</p>
<p>The group previously held a 5.7 percent stake in the trust.</p>
</text>
